{"id": "rsipool-i-024", "dimension": "instruction", "tier": "medium", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "用 38-68 个字说明M08 冷却液指令，不要分点，不要标题。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 256, "tags": ["format_constraint", "instruction_following"], "gold": {"answer": "M08 开启冷却液，M09 关闭；粗加工用大流量冲刷切屑并降温，精加工可改用内冷，防止热变形影响尺寸稳定。", "derivation": "字数落在此区间内且内容切题。"}, "criteria": [{"type": "length_between", "key": "length", "weight": 2, "min": 38, "max": 68}, {"type": "literal_all", "key": "keywords", "weight": 1, "values": ["M08"]}]}
{"id": "rsipool-i-025", "dimension": "instruction", "tier": "medium", "language": "zh", "system": null, "context": [], "prompt": "用 42-72 个字说明G90 与 G91 的区别，不要分点，不要标题。", "images": [], "max_tokens": 256, "tags": ["format_constraint", "instruction_following"], "gold": {"answer": "G90 是绝对坐标编程，坐标值相对工件原点；G91 是增量坐标编程，坐标值相对上一位置；混用会直接导致过切或撞刀。", "derivation": "字数落在此区间内且内容切题。"}, "criteria": [{"type": "length_between", "key": "length", "weight": 2, "min": 42, "max": 72}, {"type": "literal_all", "key": "keywords", "weight": 1, "values": ["G90"]}]}
